    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为什么说生命中的一切痛苦来源于真实自我的迷失？为什么找回您的本来面目是活出自带光芒人生的关键？这期节目佳程邀请她的教练姐妹： 坐标在西雅图的职业生涯规划师 Amanda。一起与大家分享如何找回真实的自我，从而获得生命的力量！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 为什么要聊找回真实自我这个话题？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> “空心人”是什么意思？为什么做“空心人”会流泪？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 佳程感到最“空心”最不知道自己是谁，最纠结难过的时刻</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 佳程感到想要“觉醒”但又还没觉醒的时刻是什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 佳程找到真实自我后的生活状态</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 佳程找到真实自我的转折点：参加Academy for Coaching Excellence (ACE)教练培训课程<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 练习1: standards of integrity 我自己是谁，我有什么特质</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 练习2: life intention 我的人生中哪些“游戏”对我来说很重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> human doing vs. human being</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> Amanda高中时追问人生意义的故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">26:26</a> 每一个人生来自带使命，找到它是我们“觉醒”的前提</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> “觉醒”是什么意思？它有什么好处？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 如何找到真实的自我呢？我怎么知道我是谁呢？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> Amanda分享她是如何找到真实自我的时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">37:35</a> Amanda“觉醒”后直面恐惧，在脑海中看到自己想要的生活画面</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 如何你不知道如何打破眼前的处境，该怎么做？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 佳程对“觉醒”的理解</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 佳程第一次被教练的时候感受到被“点醒”<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> “这是你的事，他的事，还是上天的事？”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> 我们竟然不知道我的人生属于我自己！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2823">47:03</a> 把自己放在角色背后的人生长什么样？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> Amanda分享papi酱的采访：给自己，配偶，孩子，父母排序</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> “空心病”的弊端：把他人的使命愿景当成自己的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> "空心"的状态不仅对自己有影响，对别人也有影响</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3292">54:52</a> 桃子理论🍑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3471">57:51</a> 把真实自我活出来，有机生长的方法<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">58:10</a> Amanda工具分享：7 levels deep（由外而内找到自己的内核）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3883">1:04:43</a> 佳程的工具分享：standards of integrity and life intention （由内而外找到自己的内核）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>了解佳程</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>个人故事文：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LqVPLt4nOzGPLNxSk1R38A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LqVPLt4nOzGPLNxSk1R38A"><span>从生命文盲到生命教练，我在美国“历劫”十年</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>英文网站：lightoncoaching.com</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>联系佳程：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>微信：jiacheng2029 (注明来意）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:Dr.lu@lightoncoaching.com"><span>Dr.lu@lightoncoaching.com</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>支持佳程：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://chuffed.org/project/light-on-chinese-internationals" data-url="https://chuffed.org/project/light-on-chinese-internationals"><span>chuffed.org</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
